/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Lift: Evaluates the importance of a rule. It is the ratio of the observed support to that expected if the antecedent and consequent were independent.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
