550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this report, we conduct a thorough association rule mining analysis on the "10000 Sales Records" dataset employing the Apriori algorithm. This analysis utilises the arules and arulesViz packages in R, renowned for their efficiency and effectiveness in mining association rules. Our objective is to extract actionable insights from the sales transaction data, generating rules that highlight patterns in regional sales behaviour, product categories, and other influencing dimensions such as sales channels and order priorities. By doing so, we aim to equip decision-makers with the knowledge necessary to enhance customer engagement, optimise sales strategies, and ultimately drive business growth.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As well as In this report, we might be considered the association rule mining is performed on the "10000 Sales Records" dataset with the Apriori algorithm, using the arules and arulesViz packages in R. The objective is to derive actionable insights from sales transaction data by producing rules that indicate patterns in regional sales behaviour, item categories, and other dimensions like sales channels and order priorities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
