/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A frequently utilized data mining technique used to find intriguing patterns or associations among variables in big datasets is association rule mining. Based on an item's co-occurrence in a transaction or event, it seeks to determine associations or relationships between it. Therefore, the aim of using association rule mining to this dataset is to identify relationships and patterns that causes diabetes in patients. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
