/E (The targeted rules were thoughtfully visualized through a combination of scatterplots and grouped matrix plots, which helped to illuminate the intricate relationships and trends within the dataset. To further enhance user engagement and interaction, we developed a dynamic plotly dashboard. This dashboard provides a user-friendly interface that allows individuals to explore the rules in real-time.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
719 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Within the dashboard, users can easily manipulate various visualizations based on key metrics such as lift, confidence, and support. For instance, by adjusting these parameters, users can uncover deeper insights about the data, discovering not just what the rules are, but also how strongly they relate to each other. This interactive experience fosters a greater understanding of the underlying patterns and enables users to make more informed decisions based on the insights gathered. Ultimately, the combination of visual tools and interactivity creates a richer, more intuitive exploration of the data.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2]
>>
