>>
endobj
753 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In conclusion, this study validates that association rule mining, when adeptly applied and interpreted, offers a solid foundation for cultivating data-driven business strategies, ultimately empowering organisations to make informed decisions and thrive in competitive markets. This work demonstrated the potential of association rule mining to expose interesting knowledge within sales transactional data. Significant patterns such as the dominance of cosmetics in Sub-Saharan African internet purchases or Fruits' popularity in the Middle East market were)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (These results not only contribute to regional inventory planning and demand forecasting but also provide significant input into creating marketing campaigns. For example, understanding that cosmetics primarily sell online in Sub-Saharan Africa can affect specialised online marketing campaigns and promotional campaigns within the region.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
755 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Moreover, rule pruning to reduce redundancy improved the interpretability and legibility of the results to enable decision-makers to focus on the most important rules. Future analyses could involve time trends, seasonal patterns, or combine price and profit margins for more informative ones.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
756 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Overall, this study validates that association rule mining, when used and interpreted correctly, presents a solid platform for data-driven business strategy.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
>>
