786 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This research highlights the importance of leveraging transactional sales data to inform profit-maximizing business decisions under conditions of economic uncertainty. Through using the 10,000 Sales Records dataset with diverse variables such as region, item type, sales channel, and order priority, businesses can establish predictive models for classifying and forecasting the financial effects of sales. Logistic regression, as such, enables the analysis of variables like profitability by region and efficiency of sales channels to make informed cost-saving, pricing, and more effective marketing and resource allocation decisions.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
