788 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This report explores the boundaries of machine learning and commercial intelligence through algorithm driven logistic regression in R, and in doing so, creates a more targeted and programmable Sales strategies. Inventory control, customer base, market growth and advanced profitability along with competitive advantage would be possible through these findings. This study sets the groundwork for the intelligent system for sales modern management using data mining techniques.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
