/E (The structural features of the dataset itself are was enough to be able to satisfy the needs of the following operations, such as data analysis, forecasting, or machine learning, with the main area of application being the forecasting of profits. The properties of the dataset are quite fit for classification models \(logistic regression\) that would be quite helpful for companies who can understand the dominant profitable drivers, have extended pricing strategy skills, and be good at deciding the best way, thereby enhancing the field of total performance and competitive advantage.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [2]
>>
