800 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The data set was properly checked prior to model building. It contains no missing values or inconsistent entries, which means data pre-processing and cleaning have been done. Categorical variables such as Region, Item Type, Order Priority, and Sales Channel were encoded into numbers for easy analysis using logistic regression. Moreover, some new variables such as Profitability Label were added by using the binary threshold function on the field Total Profit and labelling each record as profitable or not profitable respectively as 1 or 0. All of the variables were normalized or standardized where ever necessary to incorporate uniformity to the modelling activity.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [1]
>>
