1045 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The logistic regression analysis aimed to identify factors influencing the likelihood of achieving 'HighProfit'. The results indicate that 'Units.Sold' and 'Total.Cost' are significant predictors; specifically, higher values in both are associated with a greater probability of high profit. Conversely, 'Order.Priority' \(across all levels\) and 'Sales.Channel' did not demonstrate a statistically significant effect on 'HighProfit' within this model. Despite the non-significance of some predictors, the model as a whole represents a considerable improvement over a baseline model with no predictors. However, the observed positive correlation between 'Total.Cost' and 'HighProfit' warrants further scrutiny to understand the underlying dynamics. The model fitting process was successful, converging after seven iterations.)
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
